  "abstract": "This experiment investigates the learning rate hyperparameter for the SOTA MoLR v1 architecture. The current learning rate of 9e-4 was inherited from the simpler MoG v2 model. I hypothesize that my more expressive MoLR model may benefit from a lower learning rate for more stable convergence. This submission tests a learning rate of 5e-4, while keeping all other hyperparameters and the BASE_SEED fixed for a controlled comparison against the SOTA run (ID 475).",
